      { "@type": "Question", "name": "How much does an emergency plumber cost in Maghull?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "£120 for the first hour on weekdays 9am to 4pm. £150 for the first hour on weekday evenings, nights and weekends. £180 for the first hour on bank holidays. Extra time is priced before we carry on. Parts at cost. Most jobs cost £120 to £350. Written quote before work starts. No call-out fee." } },
