        <h2 style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Maghull Is The Next Postcode From Us.</h2>
        <p style="font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--navy);line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:0;">Our base is at <strong>29 Park Road, Kirkby, L32 2AL</strong>. Kirkby is L32, Maghull is L31. We're next door. The A59 or a quick run through Switch Island gets us to most of Maghull quickly.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65;margin-top:0.75rem;">The other plumbers ranking for emergency plumber Maghull are based in Liverpool city, Lancashire, or are national call centres dispatching to whoever's nearest. Our vans drive Liverpool Road North every day.</p>
