        <a href="/boiler-service-liverpool" class="pf-related-link"><div><strong>Boiler Service Maghull</strong><span>Annual boiler service from £120. Gas Safe engineers. Certificate same day. Keeps your warranty valid.</span></div><span class="pf-related-arrow">&#8594;</span></a>
