  <section class="pf-section" style="background:#f8fafc;">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Why Maghull Customers Choose Us</h2>
      <div class="pf-why-grid" style="margin-top:2rem;">
        <div class="pf-why-item"><h3>30 Minute Response from Next Door</h3><p>Our base at 29 Park Road, Kirkby is the next postcode from Maghull. A short run via the A59 or through Switch Island.</p></div>
        <div class="pf-why-item"><h3>Sefton Suburban Specialists</h3><p>Maghull is in Sefton, not Liverpool. We know the council, the wards (Molyneux, Park, Sudell), the Neighbourhood Plan and the local planning rules.</p></div>
        <div class="pf-why-item"><h3>Gas Safe Registered Plumber</h3><p>Every engineer is Gas Safe registered. Check our entry at <a href="https://www.gassaferegister.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">gassaferegister.co.uk</a>.</p></div>
