        <details class="pf-faq-item"><summary><span class="pf-faq-tag pf-tag-orange">COST</span><span class="pf-faq-q">How much does an emergency plumber cost in Maghull?</span></summary><div class="pf-faq-body"><p>£120 for the first hour on weekdays 9am to 4pm. £150 for the first hour on weekday evenings, nights and weekends. £180 for the first hour on bank holidays. Extra time is priced before we carry on. Parts at cost. Most jobs cost £120 to £350 total. Written quote before work starts. No call-out fee.</p></div></details>
        <details class="pf-faq-item"><summary><span class="pf-faq-tag pf-tag-navy">RESPONSE</span><span class="pf-faq-q">How quickly can you reach Maghull?</span></summary><div class="pf-faq-body"><p>We're based in Kirkby. Maghull is the next postcode over. It's a short run via the A59 or through Switch Island, and we guarantee a 30 minute response. A real person picks up the phone any time of day or night.</p></div></details>
        <details class="pf-faq-item"><summary><span class="pf-faq-tag pf-tag-orange">LOCAL</span><span class="pf-faq-q">Are you local to Maghull?</span></summary><div class="pf-faq-body"><p>Yes. We're at 29 Park Road, Kirkby, L32 2AL. Kirkby is the next postcode south of Maghull. Many of our customers are within 4 miles of our base. The other plumbers ranking for emergency plumber Maghull are based further away or run national call centres.</p></div></details>
        <details class="pf-faq-item"><summary><span class="pf-faq-tag pf-tag-navy">SEMIS</span><span class="pf-faq-q">Do you work on 1970s and 1980s semis?</span></summary><div class="pf-faq-body"><p>Yes. That stock is most of Maghull. Copper supply pipes with compression fittings. System boilers with hot water cylinders. 40 to 50 year old heating systems. We know the typical fault patterns and carry common parts on the van.</p></div></details>
        <details class="pf-faq-item"><summary><span class="pf-faq-tag pf-tag-green">CYLINDER</span><span class="pf-faq-q">My hot water cylinder is leaking. What should I do?</span></summary><div class="pf-faq-body"><p>Turn off the water supply at the isolation valve on the cold feed pipe (the pipe entering at the bottom). If the leak is from the cylinder body itself, the cylinder must be replaced. If the leak is from a fitting or valve, we may be able to repair it. Call us on <a href="tel:01515580334">0151 558 0334</a>. New cylinders from £750 fitted.</p></div></details>
        <details class="pf-faq-item"><summary><span class="pf-faq-tag pf-tag-orange">AREAS</span><span class="pf-faq-q">Do you cover Lydiate and Melling?</span></summary><div class="pf-faq-body"><p>Yes. Lydiate, Melling, Aughton borders, and the rest of L31 are all covered at the same fixed rates. Same guaranteed 30 minute response.</p></div></details>
        <details class="pf-faq-item"><summary><span class="pf-faq-tag pf-tag-navy">GAS SAFE</span><span class="pf-faq-q">Are your engineers Gas Safe registered?</span></summary><div class="pf-faq-body"><p>Yes. All gas work is done by our Gas Safe registered engineers. Check our entry at <a href="https://www.gassaferegister.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">gassaferegister.co.uk</a>. It's against the law to work on gas without it.</p></div></details>
